// 1-22: hop the blocks. mind the gaps.
id l1-22
name 1-22 BATTLEMENTS
tagline hop the blocks. mind the gaps.
bg hall
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main pull anchor neon
mechanics current:24 plank:4 pull:10 anchor:7 yank:2 hack:1 lift:1 capacitor:2 neon:3 white:1 secret:2
new -
portion 4 a secret wall 8 wide with packets inside, or climb over it
portion 5.8 zip 3 anchors (high, mid, ceiling), 8-9 apart, over current
portion 5.3 hop 4 one-way planks over current (heights 2121)
portion 5.1 hack port opens a gate, 5-wide current beyond
portion 5.1 jump 3 current notches, 6 wide, 3 apart
portion 4.6 hop 3 blocks 2 tall and 3 wide over 3-wide current
portion 6 capacitor gate 22 tiles away
portion 6 drive a rail 8 long, swing a 22 gap (ceiling, mid anchors)
portion 5 a 3-tall plateau 9 wide with a current notch on top
portion 5 capacitor lift up through gates to the top lane
portion 3 blocks 3 tall: double jump
portion 6 hop 3 pull ports (high, ceiling, ceiling), 8-8 apart, over current
portion 6.5 hop 4 pull ports (high, ceiling, ceiling, mid), 8-7-7 apart, over current
portion 5 a low ceiling 12 long over a current notch
portion 6.3 neon/white stones nWnn (2 wide, 4 apart) over current
portion 6.8 drive a rail 10 long, swing a 26 gap (ceiling, high anchors)
portion 5.5 a 4-tall plateau 10 wide with a current notch on top
portion 5.8 hop 3 pull ports (low, high, ceiling), 8-7 apart, over current
portion 5 a low ceiling 10 long over a current notch
hardness 5.4
map
